<title>BELGIUM: Colruyt sees at least 2.1 bln bfr 96/97 profit.</title>
<headline>Colruyt sees at least 2.1 bln bfr 96/97 profit.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1996-09-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Belgian retailer Colruyt said in a statement on Wednesday it expected to book a net profit of at least 2.1 billion francs in the current fiscal year which ends in March 1997.</p>
<p>An updated forecast will be issued at the beginning of January.</p>
<p>-- Brussels Newsroom +32 2 287 6810, Fax +32 2 230 7710</p>
